caway/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-01-10T19:20:12Z","updated_at":"2019-01-10T19:20:12Z","body":"Note for @mbautin \r\nAfter the raising error for non-existing table, YugaByte crashed.\r\nThe crash might be due to TWO errors are raised for ONE statement execution.\r\n\r\npostgres# CREATE TABLE feature_tab_date (feature_col DATE);\r\n\r\n1- First, correctly raised ERROR\r\nERROR: DATE is not yet supported.\r\nAfter this error is raised, \"DROP table feature_tab_date\" was executed by the system to clean up the execution.\r\n\r\n2- Second ERROR raised but should be silent --> crash\r\nERROR: Not found: The table does not exist: table_id: \"000047c5000030008000000000006755\"\r\n- TestPgRegress crashes after this SECOND error due to unexpected behavior?\r\n- Should this have been a LOG(error) instead of crashing?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/453219887/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"nocaway","id":31016169,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDE2MTY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31016169?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway","html_url":"https://github.com/nocaway","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/orgs","repos_url":"https:/